WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.360
Matthew 16

00:30.000 --> 00:59.980
Matthew 16

01:00.000 --> 01:29.980
Matthew 16

01:30.000 --> 01:59.980
Matthew 16

02:00.000 --> 02:03.840
You are the Christ, the Son of the living God.

02:04.200 --> 02:06.040
And Jesus answered him,

02:06.780 --> 02:08.900
Blessed are you, Simon Barjona,

02:09.300 --> 02:11.980
for flesh and blood has not revealed this to you,

02:12.280 --> 02:13.960
but my Father who is in heaven.

02:14.320 --> 02:16.960
And I tell you, you are Peter,

02:17.340 --> 02:19.740
and on this rock I will build my church,

02:20.040 --> 02:22.680
and the gates of hell shall not prevail against it.

02:23.360 --> 02:26.000
I will give you the keys of the kingdom of heaven,

02:26.000 --> 02:29.160
and whatever you bind on earth shall be bound in heaven.

02:29.160 --> 02:33.260
And whatever you loose on earth shall be loosed in heaven.

02:33.740 --> 02:37.780
Then he strictly charged the disciples to tell no one

02:37.780 --> 02:39.620
that he was the Christ.

02:40.460 --> 02:43.780
From that time Jesus began to show his disciples

02:43.780 --> 02:47.480
that he must go to Jerusalem and suffer many things

02:47.480 --> 02:50.480
from the elders and chief priests and scribes

02:50.480 --> 02:54.500
and be killed and on the third day be raised.

02:55.180 --> 02:58.300
And Peter took him aside and began to rebuke him,

02:58.300 --> 02:58.720
saying,

02:59.160 --> 03:01.120
Far be it from you, Lord.

03:01.660 --> 03:03.080
This shall never happen to you.

03:03.800 --> 03:06.540
But he turned and said to Peter,

03:07.300 --> 03:09.180
Get behind me, Satan.

03:10.000 --> 03:11.460
You are a hindrance to me,

03:11.860 --> 03:14.960
for you are not setting your mind on the things of God,

03:15.360 --> 03:16.940
but on the things of man.

03:17.620 --> 03:20.340
Then Jesus told his disciples,

03:20.900 --> 03:23.180
If anyone would come after me,

03:23.540 --> 03:26.680
let him deny himself and take up his cross and follow me.

03:26.860 --> 03:29.020
For whoever would save his life,

03:29.160 --> 03:30.120
will lose it.

03:30.660 --> 03:34.280
But whoever loses his life for my sake will find it.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.860
For what will it profit a man

03:36.860 --> 03:40.060
if he gains the whole world and forfeits his soul?

03:41.060 --> 03:44.780
Or what shall a man give in return for his soul?

03:45.440 --> 03:48.600
For the Son of Man is going to come with his angels

03:48.600 --> 03:50.520
in the glory of his Father,

03:50.840 --> 03:54.760
and then he will repay each person according to what he has done.

03:55.540 --> 03:56.880
Truly I say to you,

03:56.880 --> 03:58.860
there are some standing here

03:58.860 --> 04:00.160
who will not taste death

04:00.160 --> 04:03.900
until they see the Son of Man coming in his kingdom.

